/E (The organizers hope that the conference was an occasion for all the attendees to enrich their scientific background and get new ideas to inspire their work, and that they enjoyed the organization. Such a big event required a huge work by all the committees involved, which are too many to list here. It is possible to find the full list of involved persons on the conference website. We hope that this hard work was fruitful. We also want to warmly thank the sponsors of the event.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [12]
>>
