758 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 607 0 R
/E (In addition, a number of Best Scientific Paper and Best Student Paper awards will be presented, along with the Best Industry Related Paper Award and the Piero Zamperoni Best Student Paper Award. Congratulations to the recipients of all of these very well-deserved awards!)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
